  "release_adaptations": [
    "Environment-only API credential and endpoint; local credential database discovery and unrelated clients removed.",
    "External inputs and outputs; original hardcoded input paths and old author-specific operational scripts excluded.",
    "Minimal abstract client and actually used prompt assets; current prompts and runtime text translated into English.",
    "Historical retry-budget override removed: maximum five explicit-failure attempts per exact request; uncertain outcomes stop.",
    "Generation ends after validation selection. Historical generation-classifier test fitting is not the selected main-table evaluation; reproduce.py implements that evaluation.",
    "Unused module-local demonstrations removed. Language adaptation preserves numerical formula/screening rules but changes prompt text and textual feedback recognition.",
    "English API documentation replaces Chinese comments/docstrings. Internal panel grouping keys are firm_id and year.",
    "English gate messages, rejection categories, and prompt-policy substitutions are covered by offline regression tests.",
    "English generation is a new prompt-language variant; no exact historical LLM-response equivalence is claimed. Start a new work directory.",
    "Added authorized CSMAR acquisition/preparation guidance and a local aggregate-only panel validator.",
    "Evaluation defaults to all ten paper classifier seeds with fixed formulas and parameters. README text and redundant comments/docstrings shortened.",
    "Generation runs exactly 100 rounds and applies the same validation-only subset/full-pool/Base selection rule. The frozen main-experiment winner contains 100 formulas."
  ],
